      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Example: Quite likely, reward 100 gold\n  3 lives: 0.75 x 100 - 0.25 x 80  = +55\n  1 life:  0.75 x 100 - 0.25 x 240 = +15\nSame ad, lower EV as lives drop.\n\nTrap tag: the message contains \"steal\" (CORE-07).\n\nAdvice only: the EV never reorders the board\nand never marks a best pick (FUN-01, WEB-07).\nWith the toggle off, no EV and no trap tag show.",
      "originalText": "Example: Quite likely, reward 100 gold\n  3 lives: 0.75 x 100 - 0.25 x 80  = +55\n  1 life:  0.75 x 100 - 0.25 x 240 = +15\nSame ad, lower EV as lives drop.\n\nTrap tag: the message contains \"steal\" (CORE-07).\n\nAdvice only: the EV never reorders the board\nand never marks a best pick (FUN-01, WEB-07).\nWith the toggle off, no EV and no trap tag show.",
